    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-14","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","person:tolkien-jrr","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Толкин и «Хоббит» хорошо узнаются, хотя Льюис, Пулман и Пратчетт принадлежат к тому же фэнтезийному полю и требуют прочитать название.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-15","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"«Война и мир» и Толстой входят в базовый школьный канон; Достоевский и Тургенев лишь проверяют различение русских классиков.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-16","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Гюго для «Отверженных» достаточно известен, но Бальзак, Дюма и Золя заставляют выбрать автора внутри французского социального романа.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-17","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Дюма — ожидаемый автор «Графа Монте-Кристо», хотя Гюго, Бальзак и Мериме остаются близкими французскими именами XIX века.","confidence":"medium","editorial_flags":["collaborative-authorship-context"]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-18","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Стивенсон и «Остров сокровищ» широко знакомы по детскому приключенческому канону; Дефо и Верн лишь расширяют тот же жанровый ряд.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-19","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Стокер обычно вспоминается вместе с «Дракулой», однако Шелли и Уайльд создают убедительный готико-викторианский контекст.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-20","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Конан Дойл и Шерлок Холмс почти не требуют специальной подготовки; По и Честертон тематически уместны, но не меняют ясную ассоциацию.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-21","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Марк Твен и Том Сойер — повседневно узнаваемая пара; Лондон и Купер подходят как американские приключенческие авторы, но не по героям.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
