    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-23","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Гоголь и «Мёртвые души» узнаются по школьному канону, но Тургенев и Салтыков-Щедрин поддерживают правдоподобную русскую сатирическую альтернативу.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-24","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Тургенев для «Отцов и детей» узнаваем, но Толстой, Достоевский и Гончаров заставляют отличать близких русских романистов.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-25","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Чехов и «Вишнёвый сад» известны, но Горький и Островский делают вопрос точнее, чем простое узнавание русского автора.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-26","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Пушкин и «Капитанская дочка» требуют вспомнить не только поэта; Лермонтов, Гоголь и Тургенев составляют убедительный круг русской прозы XIX века.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-27","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Данте для «Божественной комедии» обычно узнаваем, однако Петрарка, Боккаччо и Ариосто требуют различить авторов итальянского канона.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-28","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Традиционную атрибуцию «Одиссеи» Гомеру знают многие, но Вергилий, Софокл и Еврипид требуют не спутать античные жанры и авторство.","confidence":"medium","editorial_flags":["traditional-attribution"]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-29","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Верн и «Двадцать тысяч лье под водой» составляют очень знакомую пару; Уэллс и Стивенсон остаются тематически честными авторами приключений.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-classic","question_id":"prep-books-classic-30","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Барри для «Питера Пэна и Венди» надо отличить от Милна, Кэрролла и Грэма — знакомых, но разных авторов детского литературного канона.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-01","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Оруэлл и «1984» — общеизвестная антиутопическая пара; Хаксли и Брэдбери близки жанром, но не названием романа.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-02","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Маркес для «Ста лет одиночества» требует отличить его от Борхеса, Альенде и Варгаса Льосы внутри латиноамериканской прозы.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-03","difficulty_level":6,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Эко и «Имя розы» — подготовленное читательское знание; Кальвино, Борхес и Маркес не выглядят случайными для интеллектуального романа о библиотеке.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-04","difficulty_level":1,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Роулинг и первая книга о Гарри Поттере почти универсально узнаваемы, а уточнение британского названия дополнительно подтверждает выбор.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-05","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Коллинз и «Голодные игры» широко известны; Рот и Лоури подходят как авторы подростковой антиутопии, но не по серии.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-06","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","person:tolkien-jrr","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Толкин и «Властелин колец» — очень узнаваемая авторская связь, несмотря на близких жанровых альтернатив Льюиса, Ле Гуин и Пратчетта.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-07","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Брэдбери и «451° по Фаренгейту» известны, но Оруэлл и Хаксли создают особенно сильную антиутопическую конкуренцию.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-08","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Коэльо и «Алхимик» хорошо узнаются по массовой популярности, однако Маркес и Борхес удерживают вопрос в латиноамериканском литературном поле.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-09","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Харпер Ли и «Убить пересмешника» — известная связка, но Капоте как её современник делает авторский выбор менее механическим.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-10","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Булгаков и «Мастер и Маргарита» входят в русский культурный минимум; Пастернак и Солженицын создают разумный ряд авторов XX века.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-11","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Хоссейни для «Бегущего за ветром» требует знать современный роман; Памук, Маалуф и Сафарли близки культурным регионом, но не сюжетом.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-12","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Мураками и «Норвежский лес» достаточно известны, но Исигуро, Мисима и Рю Мураками требуют различать реальных японских или японско-связанных писателей.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-13","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Исигуро для «Не отпускай меня» узнаётся подготовленным читателем; Макьюэн, Барнс и Эмис образуют правдоподобный ряд современных британских авторов.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-14","difficulty_level":2,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Браун и «Код да Винчи» широко узнаваемы; Эко похож жанром интеллектуального детектива, но не знаменитым названием.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-15","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Ларссона нужно выделить среди Несбё, Манкеля и Лэкберг — именно из-за близкого скандинавского криминального поля вариантов.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-16","difficulty_level":3,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:recognition","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Герберт и «Дюна» — узнаваемая научно-фантастическая пара, однако Азимов, Ле Гуин и Кларк делают выбор жанрово содержательным.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-17","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Этвуд для «Рассказа служанки» требует конкретного знания антиутопии; Лессинг и Картер сохраняют правдоподобную женскую англоязычную альтернативу.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-18","difficulty_level":5,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Моррисон и «Возлюбленная» — более специализированное знание; Уокер, Энджелоу и Хёрстон предлагают близкий круг американских писательниц.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-19","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Зусак для «Книжного вора» нужно вспомнить среди Бойна, Дорра и Морпурго, которые также ассоциируются с военной и подростковой прозой.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-20","difficulty_level":5,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Макьюэн и «Искупление» требуют точного знания современного британского романа; Барнс, Эмис и Исигуро специально близки по литературному полю.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-21","difficulty_level":5,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Сафон для «Тени ветра» — менее массовая авторская связь; Перес-Реверте, Мариас и Варгас Льоса делают испаноязычный набор вариантов убедительным.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-22","difficulty_level":5,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Зюскинд и «Парфюмер» известны не всем, а Грасс, Манн и Гессе требуют различать немецкоязычных авторов за пределами одного жанра.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-23","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Маккарти и «Дорога» требуют припомнить конкретный постапокалиптический роман, а Делилло и Франзен не отсеиваются по одной только национальности.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-24","difficulty_level":6,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Митчелл и «Облачный атлас» — нишевая связь, а Макьюэн, Барнс и Эмис выглядят равноправными современными британскими авторами.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]},
    {"provider":"quiz","pack_id":"preparation-books-modern","question_id":"prep-books-modern-25","difficulty_level":4,"editorial_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","skill:direct-recall","topic:literary-works","topic:writers"],"context_tag_ids":["domain:literature","medium:book","topic:literary-works"],"rationale":"Мартел и «Жизнь Пи» нужно отличить от Ондатже, Мистри и Рушди, которые тоже образуют правдоподобный круг современной англоязычной прозы.","confidence":"high","editorial_flags":[]}
  ]
